  "label": "Textual phrase maps to visual group as incomplete entity",
  "description": "The text 'prospective without white \"\"' is mapped onto the visual group of Black men in traditional warrior attire. The phrase implies that the group is 'incomplete' or 'lacking' without white people, thereby projecting a dehumanizing racial hierarchy onto the visual material. The visual group is thus analogically mapped as the 'prospective' entity that is 'without white', reinforcing an anti-Black stereotype rooted in white supremacist ideology.",
